      "dtype": "uint8",
      "enum_map": null,
      "notes": "Brake-lamp ACTUAL state: the request delayed by brake_light.actuation_latency_s. Two signals, not one: a requirement written on illumination needs the lamp state, not the request. MF4 unit string: ''; published ASCII-canonicalised.",
